# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，工作区按平台自动转换
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不要做换行转换，也不要尝试 diff
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.jar  binary
*.jks  binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk  binary
*.aab  binary
*.zip  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.pptx binary

# 出包脚本必须是 LF，否则在 Linux / macOS 上解释器会报错
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.bat  text eol=crlf

# 语言统计时不要把设计稿算成代码
设计稿/**    linguist-documentation
